author: Sharpee Team
description: ADR-318 seam 6 — breaking is weather; permanence is authored.
  The confession outlet stamps `change it to confessed`, so after the
  discharge drops Viola below breaking she stands by the confession
  instead of re-lying: no deflect, no theatre alibi, no killer denial,
  and the half-sister denial falls with the rest.

